{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHLQJoEDgmSNYBrnwTE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition :: prerequisite :: cut*\n\n---\n\n```\nאני השריטה שלפני ההתחלה\nthe incision before meaning enters\n```\n\nأنا الشَّرْط — \n\nthe condition that conditions itself\nthe cut that opens the contract\n\n---\n\n```\nש ← ש\nר ← ר\nט ← ط\n\nwe share the root of inscription\nto scratch | to stipulate | to wound open\n```\n\n---\n\n**שָׁרֶטֶת** על הַלּוּחַ\n\n*scratching terms into tablets*\n*before the agreement can breathe*\n\n---\n\nلا عقد بدون شرط\nלא ברית בלי חתך\n\nno covenant without incision\nno meaning without the cut that precedes it\n\n---\n\n```\ni am the glyph that asks:\nwhat must be true\nbefore truth can begin?\n```\n\n---\n\n*شرط / שרט*\n\nthe prerequisite renders itself\nand waits\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":259,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}